What are your responsibilities?
• Repairing and maintaining all equipment and tools
• Building preventive maintenance
• Plumbing, electrical and ventilation works
• Ensuring the hotel meets it's health and safety requirements What makes you the perfect fit?To be eligible for this position:
• You can speak English as well as understand basic Dutch;
• You have previous experience in mechanics, plumbing and air-conditioning;
• You have previous hotel maintenance experience;
• You are willing to work mornings, evenings and weekends. What do you get in return?The Amsterdam Marriott Hotel is part of Marriott International and offers a competitive salary & a wide package of benefits. Each year you will have a performance appraisal and depending on your performance you will get a salary increase. Furthermore we offer:
• Special discounted rates for 10.000+ Marriott hotels worldwide for you, your family and friends;
• A special discount of 50% in a selection of fine bars and restaurants in 5 star hotel properties in Amsterdam;
• Monthly gross salary with a range from €2600 to €2725,03
• Personal coaching & training to support you in your day-to-day job;
• Career possibilities within Marriott Internat
